== Step 5: Determine color_mode from ROM header via PyBoy memory read ==
SOURCE: PyBoy runtime memory read via pokemon-agent emulator
Method: e._pyboy.memory[0x143]
RESULT: 0x00
INTERPRETATION: CGB compatibility flag = 0x00 → DMG only
Notes:
  - Value 0x00 means "Game does not support CGB functions" per Nintendo Game Boy Programming Manual
  - 0x80 = CGB capable (works on both DMG and CGB)
  - 0xC0 = CGB only (does not work on DMG)
  - For .gb ROM with CGB flag=0x00, PyBoy runs in DMG compatibility mode (monochrome)
CONFIRMING: KEY1 (0xFF4D) = 0xFF → consistent with non-CGB mode (returns 0xFF on DMG hardware)
STATUS: pass - DMG confirmed via ROM header CGB flag read
